      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your love for your child is clearly immense, but that love is being twisted into a desperate desire to escape, not to protect. The pain you feel is real, but the solution you're imagining is permanent and final. Instead of viewing your existence as theft, see it as a chance to finally be the one who gets the help they deserve. Please, let someone else carry this unbearable weight with you; call or text 988 right now.",
